/T <>
/E <>
/Pg 17 0 R
>>
endobj
239 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/T (When the downshift button is pressed, the ECU uses the ETB to automatically blip the throttle, momentarily increasing engine RPM to match the gearbox input speed. This rev-matching technique allows smooth, clutchless downshifting.)
/E (When the downshift button is pressed, the ECU uses the ETB to automatically blip the throttle, momentarily increasing engine RPM to match the gearbox input speed. This rev-matching technique allows smooth, clutchless downshifting.)
/Pg 17 0 R
>>
